.TH start-cli-notification-push 1  "push "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-notification\-push \- Commands for managing browser push notification subscriptions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli notification push\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commands for managing browser push notification subscriptions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
start\-cli\-notification\-push\-list(1)
List browser push notification subscriptions
.TP
start\-cli\-notification\-push\-test(1)
Send a test notification to a push subscription
.TP
start\-cli\-notification\-push\-unsubscribe(1)
Remove a browser push notification subscription
